  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-dc07844fe690ead3b17bc2ca",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "有若干因素会为可接受的采样率设定下限：1. 以闭环带宽或时间响应要求（如上升时间和调节时间）衡量的跟踪有效性；2. 以对被控对象随机扰动的误差响应衡量的调节有效性；3. 测量噪声及相关前置滤波器引起的误差。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "There are several factors that could provide a lower limit on the acceptable sample rate: 1. Tracking effectiveness as measured by closed-loop bandwidth or by time-response requirements, such as rise time and settling time; 2. Regulation effectiveness as measured by the error response to random plant disturbances; and 3. Error due to measurement noise and the associated prefilter.",
